 "sentences": [
  "Nazis tried trading one million Jewish lives.",
  "Joel Brand was a member of a Zionist group in Budapest during the Holocaust.",
  "He helped smuggle people to safety from German-occupied Europe.",
  "In 1944, SS leader Adolf Eichmann approached Brand with a shocking deal.",
  "They wanted 10,000 trucks plus tea in exchange for one million Jews.",
  "Eichmann called this horrific plan blood for goods.",
  "Ultimately, nothing came of the idea."
